  "description": "LORXUO crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H82 Er6 N12 O26. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er1A (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er2A (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3A (Er) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.506-3.752 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.87-113.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C78H82Er6N12O26.",
